1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,374
Maple Lane: a quiet suburban street in Spring Hill, at least until someone got

2
00:00:04,374 --> 00:00:04,844
murdered.

3
00:00:05,064 --> 00:00:06,813
Here's how the location plays.

4
00:00:07,633 --> 00:00:11,806
Make four Item decks of three cards instead of the usual setup, one for each

5
00:00:11,806 --> 00:00:14,332
quadrant of houses, with the top card face up.

6
00:00:14,552 --> 00:00:17,453
Then add both Convince Action cards to the Action Tableau.

7
00:00:18,267 --> 00:00:21,080
Maple Lane has twelve Houses, three in each quadrant:

8
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:23,733
north-west, south-west, north-east and south-east.

9
00:00:23,733 --> 00:00:26,971
Every House is a search space, coloured orange to remind you.

10
00:00:27,191 --> 00:00:30,921
When you search a House successfully, draw from that quadrant's Item deck.

11
00:00:30,921 --> 00:00:33,996
Then put an X token on the House. It can't be searched again.

12
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:37,351
If a search finds two Items, keep the one you want.

13
00:00:37,351 --> 00:00:41,554
Put the other face up on top of that quadrant's deck, or face down at the bottom, as

14
00:00:41,554 --> 00:00:41,904
normal.

15
00:00:42,124 --> 00:00:46,128
If an Item ever needs adding to a quadrant where every House already has an X, add

16
00:00:46,128 --> 00:00:48,716
it to the nearest quadrant that isn't fully searched.

17
00:00:49,533 --> 00:00:51,624
The residents are suspicious of outsiders.

18
00:00:51,624 --> 00:00:55,805
You can't enter a House with any Victims in it using Walk, Sprint, or any other card

19
00:00:55,805 --> 00:00:56,552
that moves you.

20
00:00:56,772 --> 00:01:00,849
Panicking Victims and Enemies aren't restricted, so they can move into occupied

21
00:01:00,849 --> 00:01:01,572
Houses freely.

22
00:01:01,792 --> 00:01:04,992
An empty House follows the normal movement rules, in and out.

23
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:10,151
To get into an occupied House, use a Convince Action card from the adjacent Street

24
00:01:10,151 --> 00:01:14,291
space. It can only be used for that: never to leave, which is normal movement.

25
00:01:14,511 --> 00:01:17,436
Convince has an extra line for three or more successes:

26
00:01:17,436 --> 00:01:20,894
you enter, and you may also take the top Item from that quadrant.

27
00:01:20,894 --> 00:01:22,809
If you do, mark the House with an X.

28
00:01:23,633 --> 00:01:27,243
Every normal space and exit, plus the Intersection, is a Street space.

29
00:01:27,243 --> 00:01:30,183
They have no rules of their own, but cards refer to them.

30
00:01:30,403 --> 00:01:34,443
For example, one Terror card kills a Victim of your choice on a Street space.

31
00:01:34,443 --> 00:01:36,227
Keep Victims moving off the roads.

32
00:01:37,033 --> 00:01:41,262
A few tips. Each House can only be searched once, so plan routes across all four

33
00:01:41,262 --> 00:01:41,791
quadrants.

34
00:01:42,011 --> 00:01:46,384
The Bible adds two dice to Convince, and with three successes you can take the top

35
00:01:46,384 --> 00:01:48,197
Item without searching. Good luck.

